://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/779a080afc599a8ae8568c113003d11a.mp4?t=1755014334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/ff432d8750f291f6a96d29b517b878ea.poster.avif?t=1755014334\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146610/extras/ff432d8750f291f6a96d29b517b878ea.webp?t=1755014334\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=306 /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content</h2>The core gameplay of this game is a &quot;text-based puzzle visual novel&quot;. <br>You'll need to search the cursed environment for hidden &quot;Reifu&quot; cards. <br>By combining these cards, you'll gradually uncover key events to break the curse. <br>Afterward, you'll be able to view memory fragments revealed by the &quot;Yuan Shadow&quot;. <br>Through your choices, you can change their fate and guide them to &quot;Higan&quot;!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique text-based puzzle game combined with various mini-game elements, making every step full of surprises!<br></li><li>Characters with cat ears, fox ears, and rabbit ears make their appearances, and their ears even move!<br></li><li>A caring but clumsy Onee-chan, a timid yet strong-hearted girl, and a wise and eternally youthful wife\u2014are you ready to meet them?<br></li><li>Step into the mysterious world of Shrine Miko, and experience the intriguing charm of ancient rituals and mystical powers...</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tips</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>This game is suitable for players who like to read text.<br></li><li>The puzzle elements in this game require you to use your imagination to visualize the environment and gradually observe changes to find clues. Overall, a bit of creativity is needed.<br></li><li>If you find the above challenging, you can check the &quot;Tips&quot; in the menu during puzzles to get key steps. This will make the gameplay experience much easier.</li></ul>",
